{
  "$schema": "https://emdashcms.com/seed.schema.json",
  "version": "1",
  "meta": {
    "name": "HelpMeBe.Me",
    "description": "HelpMeBe.Me CMS and blog starter content",
    "author": "HelpMeBe.Me"
  },
  "settings": {
    "title": "HelpMeBe.Me",
    "tagline": "A private mirror for your time."
  },
  "collections": [
    {
      "slug": "posts",
      "label": "Blog Posts",
      "labelSingular": "Blog Post",
      "supports": ["drafts", "revisions", "search", "seo"],
      "commentsEnabled": false,
      "fields": [
        {
          "slug": "title",
          "label": "Title",
          "type": "string",
          "required": true,
          "searchable": true
        },
        {
          "slug": "excerpt",
          "label": "Excerpt",
          "type": "text",
          "searchable": true
        },
        {
          "slug": "featured_image",
          "label": "Featured Image",
          "type": "image"
        },
        {
          "slug": "content",
          "label": "Content",
          "type": "portableText",
          "searchable": true
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "taxonomies": [
    {
      "name": "category",
      "label": "Categories",
      "labelSingular": "Category",
      "hierarchical": true,
      "collections": ["posts"],
      "terms": [
        {
          "slug": "product-notes",
          "label": "Product Notes"
        },
        {
          "slug": "reflection",
          "label": "Reflection"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "tag",
      "label": "Tags",
      "labelSingular": "Tag",
      "hierarchical": false,
      "collections": ["posts"],
      "terms": [
        {
          "slug": "visibility",
          "label": "Visibility"
        },
        {
          "slug": "privacy",
          "label": "Privacy"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "menus": [
    {
      "name": "primary",
      "label": "Primary Navigation",
      "items": [
        {
          "type": "custom",
          "label": "Home",
          "url": "/"
        },
        {
          "type": "custom",
          "label": "Blog",
          "url": "/blog/"
        },
        {
          "type": "custom",
          "label": "Product Design",
          "url": "/design/"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "content": {
    "posts": [
      {
        "id": "welcome-to-helpmebeme",
        "slug": "welcome-to-helpmebeme",
        "status": "published",
        "data": {
          "title": "看见，是改变的开始",
          "excerpt": "为什么 HelpMeBe.Me 希望先帮助你看见时间，而不是再给你一套需要坚持的效率系统。",
          "content": [
            {
              "_type": "block",
              "_key": "intro",
              "style": "normal",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_type": "span",
                  "_key": "intro-text",
                  "text": "我们每天关注太多人、太多事，也不断希望被世界理解，却很少真正停下来看看自己。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "_type": "block",
              "_key": "heading",
              "style": "h2",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_type": "span",
                  "_key": "heading-text",
                  "text": "先观察，再优化"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "_type": "block",
              "_key": "body",
              "style": "normal",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_type": "span",
                  "_key": "body-text",
                  "text": "HelpMeBe.Me 自动整理你允许它看到的时间，让你诚实地回顾自己如何生活，并由你决定什么值得被长期记住。它不提供生产力评分，也不会把休息标记成失败。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "_type": "block",
              "_key": "privacy",
              "style": "normal",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_type": "span",
                  "_key": "privacy-text",
                  "text": "自动整理的 Activity 是临时的；只有你亲自确认的事情，才会成为长期的 Memory。系统看到的，不等于永久记住。"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        "taxonomies": {
          "category": ["product-notes"],
          "tag": ["visibility", "privacy"]
        }
      }
    ]
  }
}
